    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"let yourself fall\"... that sounds so final. like you're saying the only way to find peace is to just stop everything. if the striving is what's making it so hard, is there even a reason to keep struggling against the nothingness? wouldn't it just be easier to just... end the fight entirely?",
